hadiths[4]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1047","[AI-translation] Husain bin Munzir Abu Sasan se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Usman bin Affan (raziyallahu anhu) ke paas haazir tha jab Waleed ko laya gaya, us ne Fajr ki do rakat padhi thin phir kaha: Kya main tumhein aur padhaun? To do aadmiyon ne us ke khilaf gawahi di, jin mein se aik Humran tha, ke us ne sharab pi hai, aur doosre ne gawahi di ke us ne usay qai kartay dekha. To Usman ne kaha: Us ne qai na ki yahan tak ke us ne sharab pi. Phir unhon ne kaha: Ae Ali! Khaday ho aur usay koray lagao. To Ali ne kaha: Ae Hasan! Khaday ho aur usay koray lagao. To Hasan ne kaha: Us ki sakhti (ka kaam) wohi karay jis ne us ki narmi (khilafat ke mazay) liye hain. To goya Ali un se naraaz hue, phir kaha: Ae Abdullah bin Jafar! Khaday ho aur usay koray lagao. To unhon ne usay koray lagaye aur Ali (raziyallahu anhu) gintay rahay yahan tak ke chalees tak pahunchay, to kaha: Ruk jao. Phir kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chalees koray lagaye, aur Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) ne chalees lagaye, aur Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne assi lagaye, aur sab sunnat hai, aur ye (chalees) mujhe zyada pasand hai. (Muslim: 5/126)"
"1048","[AI-translation] Ali (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main kisi par koi had qaim karta aur us mein us ki maut ho jati to mujhe us par (koi) malal na hota siwae sharab walay ke, kyunke agar wo mar jaye to main us ki diyyat dunga, is liye ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay (muqarrar tadad ke saath) sunnat nahi banaya. (Muslim: 5/126). Baab: Tazeer ke koray."
"1049","[AI-translation] Abu Burda Ansari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Kisi ko das koron se zyada na mara jaye siwae Allah ki hudood mein se kisi had mein. (Muslim: 5/126). Baab: Jo koi had (walay gunah) ka murtakib ho aur usay saza di jaye to wo us ke liye kaffara hai."
"1050","[AI-translation] Ubada bin Samit (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ham se is baat par ahad liya jaisay Aap ne auraton se ahad liya tha ke ham Allah ke saath kisi cheez ko shareek na thahrayein, chori na karein, zina na karein, apni auladon ko qatl na karein aur ham mein se koi kisi par buhtan na lagaye. To tum mein se jo wafa karay us ka ajar Allah par hai, aur tum mein se jo koi had (walay gunah) ka murtakib ho aur us par had qaim ki jaye to wo us ke liye kaffara hai, aur jisay Allah ne chupaye rakha to us ka muamla Allah ki taraf hai, agar chahay to usay azaab de aur agar chahay to usay bakhsh de. (Muslim: 5/127). (Haashiya: Us ki sakhti wohi uthaye jis ne us ki narmi uthayi, ye Arabon ki aik kahawat hai; lafz ya'dah se murad buhtan aur jhoot hai.)"
